  "questionText": "Consider a database that has the relation schema EMP (EmpId, EmpName, and DeptName). An instance of the schema EMP and a SQL query on it are given below.<br><br><div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin: 12px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 0 auto;\"><thead><tr><th colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">EMP</th></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">EmpId</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">EmpName</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">DeptName</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYA</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYB</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYC</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYD</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">5</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYE</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AB</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">6</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYF</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AB</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">7</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYG</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AB</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">8</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYH</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AC</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">9</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYI</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AC</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">10</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYJ</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AC</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">11</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYK</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AD</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">12</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYL</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AD</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">13</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">XYM</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">AE</td></tr></tbody></table></div><br>The output of executing the SQL query is ____________ .",
  "assetImage": null,
  "codeBlock": "SELECT AVG(EC.Num)\nFROM EC\nWHERE (DeptName, Num) IN\n    (SELECT DeptName, COUNT(EmpId) AS EC(DeptName, Num)\n     FROM EMP\n     GROUP BY DeptName)",
  "options": [],
